    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127-a2">

                <pb facs="0149" n="75" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg75"/>

                <head>Mr. Tilley to the High Sheriff</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Provincial Secretary’s Office,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Fredericton, N. B</hi>.</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 7, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I am directed by his excellency the
                    lieutenant governor to inform you that his excellency has received intimation,
                    from her Majesty’s legation at Washington, that the consul for the United States
                    of America at St. John has intimated to you that some of the persons implicated
                    in the seizure of the Chesapeake are now in St. John.</p>
                <pb facs="0150" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>
                <p>I am directed by his excellency to instruct you, should this be the case, to
                    spare no pains to secure execution of the warrant of Mr. Justice Parker, of the
                    1st of March, 1864, now in your hands, by the immediate apprehension of the
                    parties referred to, and you will take, with secrecy and despatch, all the
                    measures necessary to effect this object.</p>
                <p>In the event of the capture of any of the parties, you will report the fact at
                    once to his excellency by telegraph.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. L. TILLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">High Sheriff</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >St. John.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
